Manipulating slots in a S4 object directly is not recommended. You can cut the tip label directly in aesthetic mapping:
ggtree(tree) + geom_tiplab(aes(label=str_sub(label, 1, -4)))

BTW: You need to provide a reproducible example, otherwise I have no idea of the problem of your code.

